"bio.back.h": "Never on the front",
"bio.back.p": "Candice Shell signs on the back of every canvas and every print: “cs” in lowercase in a white oval, then the title, the year and the edition number. The front belongs to the image, not to the person who made it.",
"bio.back.title": "Desert — Yellow",
"bio.anecdote": "Shown the gallery's wall texts for the first time, she had only one reply.",
"bio.anecdote.q": "“If you say so.”",
